        <details id="terms-of-service" @if ($expanded ?? false) open @endif><summary>Terms of service <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>SSITE provides organization updates, activities, and resources for the MCC community. Use the site and its materials for their intended school and organization purposes. Respect authorship and any restrictions shown on documents. Publishing and administrative tools are limited to assigned roles.</p><p>Keep your account secure and sign out on shared devices. Report incorrect content or account concerns to <a href="mailto:ssite@gmail.com">ssite@gmail.com</a>.</p></details>
        <details id="data-privacy" @if ($expanded ?? false) open @endif><summary>Privacy policy <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>SSITE uses your name, school email, and Microsoft account identifier to identify your account. Microsoft handles your Microsoft password.</p><p>SSITE creates your account and saves your profile photo after you agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy. If you decline during setup, SSITE discards the pending sign-in. Session cookies keep you signed in.</p><p>You can manage your photo in profile settings. Older accounts may also contain student details submitted under the previous profile setup. For privacy questions or requests to access, correct, or remove account data, contact <a href="mailto:ssite@gmail.com">ssite@gmail.com</a>.</p></details>
